Author: Nick Hung <nick@andestech.com>
Date:   Thu Jul 2 10:46:01 2026 +0800

    refactor(hybrid): extract lift_scratch_blocks from check_hybrid_handoff

    Verbatim move of the V-merge + GPR/FPR block-store lift into a private
    helper so the upcoming reset-baseline capture can reuse it. Structural;
    no behavior change (hybrid rt_c_hello e2e re-run green).

    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>

